{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4fbbc5fd-7ceb-8cf4-8f49-d8e193b3f852",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:23:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, this is Luis. Happy Friday, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yes, hello. Well, I got a parking ticket, and I'm, um, I'm not sure I'm talking to the right office for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tickets come through us, so you're good. What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was overnight parking. I was parked in front of my own house, um, on the street, and I got ticketed. I'd like to find out about a resident permit so it doesn't happen again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket handy? Read me the number off the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hang on. [pause] Um, it's, can you hear me? I'm on my cell and the reception is, [line breaks up] bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out right at the number. Say it again slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's, well, it's seven, seven, four, one, two, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven seven four one two nine. Got it, I see it. Overnight parking, issued earlier this week. Is that the one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. And, um, could somebody email me the photo of the violation? I'd like to see it. My car was in front of my own door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have the photo sent. What's the email address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well, I'd rather give that, um, [inaudible] can I give it to you slower, or is there a, well, a way to do it that isn't over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just spell it out for me, letter by letter. The line's rough but we'll get through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's d, u, l, c, e, and then, um, [line breaks up] at the usual, gmail dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dulce, at gmail dot com. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll send the photo this afternoon. For the permit, that's handled separately, and you'd need proof you live there, like a registration with that address. I can transfer you to the office that does those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, well, thank you. But one more thing first. I'm leaving on a trip, um, soon, and I'd like to pay the ticket before I go without coming in to City Hall. Is there a way to pay when you're closed? Online, or, um, a drop box or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's online payment through the city website, any hour. And there's a drop box at City Hall for checks, if you'd rather do that. Put the ticket number on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drop box, okay. I'm going that way anyway, because I have to, um, return some library books. They're weeks overdue, so I'm not proud of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the library's a separate department, so you're on your own there. Want me to transfer you for the permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, if you would. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T12:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Hang on, and safe travels."
    }
  ],
